      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "ran into the same issue. I use A6000 GPU.\nThe solution is modify `compile.sh` to meet your gpu device architecture. For me, it is:\n`nvcc -std=c++17 -Xcudafe --diag_suppress=177 --compiler-options -fPIC -lineinfo --shared bitnet_kernels.cu -lcuda -gencode=arch=compute_86,code=sm_86 -o libbitnet.so`\n\nNote that `code=compute_86` will still produce wrong answer, must be `sm_86`",
